    "body": "You might find some direction in the WebIDL spec about dictionaries. See https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#idl-dictionaries\r\n\r\nIt is assumed that if it is optional it will get a default dictionary created for it. There are rules in the WebIDL how the default dictionary is initialized. ",
